      "source_tier": 1,
      "title": "sakura miko (casual)",
      "excerpt": "The third [[official alternate costume|costume]] of [[hololive]]'s [[Sakura Miko]], as seen in post #4398758 and released in March 2021.\r\n\r\nHer casual attire consists of a [[black hat|black]] [[cat hat|cat]] [[beret]], a beige/[[yellow cardigan|light yellow cardigan]], an optional [[red scarf]], a [[collared shirt|collared]] [[long sleeves|long-sleeved]] [[white shirt]] with [[frilled sleeves]] and [[shoulder cutout]]s, a small [[red bowtie]] with a cat-shaped [[neck bell|neck]] [[jingle bell]], an [[underbust]] [[bodice]] with a [[red sash]], [[plaid skirt|plaid]] [[red skirt|red]] [[pleated skirt]] [[miniskirt]], [[black thighhighs]] held up with [[garter straps]] and [[black footwear|black]] [[loafers]]. She has [[red-framed eyewear|red-framed]] [[under-rim eyewear|bottom-rim glasses]] as an optional accesory.\r\n\r\nHer [[official alternate hairstyle|official hairstyle]] with this attire is [[long hair]] tied into [[low twintails]] with an [[ahoge]] and [[double-parted bangs]] decorated with a cherry blossom-shaped [[hairclip]] and small bows with [[cat hair ornament|cat ornaments]] on her twintails.",
      "captured_at": "2026-08-31"
    }
  ],
